    "reply": "That helps. Since she already has Original Medicare and you’re helping with rides and paperwork, a good next step is to focus on what needs to work well for her before looking at any other coverage. With Original Medicare, the practical comparison usually becomes: whether she may want added coverage for costs, separate drug coverage if needed, and whether her doctors and medicines would fit whatever option you compare next. We do not have any verified plan, doctor, or drug checks yet, so those are still open.",
